# Copy to .env (already gitignored) and fill in a real value before
# `docker compose up -d`. Never commit the real .env.
#
# Generate a key with: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# Anything else that calls this server (benchmark/eval scripts, the
# operator portal, the future agentic-layer service) needs this same
# value once it's live, or it gets a 401. See deploy/README.md's
# "Authentication" section.
VLLM_API_KEY=
